# H2 database files.
#
# The collector's database moved from in-memory to file-backed so that scraped
# price history survives a restart - re-fetching a year of daily bars for ~70
# symbols takes about twenty minutes and has to stay slow to be polite to the
# source site. That makes the file valuable locally and useless in version
# control: it is a multi-megabyte binary that changes on every scrape, so every
# pipeline run would show up as an unreviewable diff.
backend/data/
*.mv.db
*.trace.db
*.lock.db

# Build output
target/
build/
dist/
*.class
*.jar.original

# Node
node_modules/
.angular/
npm-debug.log*

# IDE and OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs and local environment
*.log
.env
.env.local
